### Login as owner
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@medflow.test", "password": "OwnerPass123" }

### Bulk process (paste token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/orders/bulk-process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "basePrice": 330, "quantity": 24 }

### Tax deduction
POST http://localhost:4000/api/tax/calculate-deduction
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assets": [{ "cost": 50000 }], "expenses": [{ "amount": 20000 }], "bulkRevenue": 100000 }

### Revenue breakdown
GET http://localhost:4000/api/analytics/revenue-breakdown
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
